From: somestupidgirl <sunnevanattsol@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtadvd: restore the sources network_cmds-741 dropped

network_cmds-741.100.2 keeps only rtadvd.tproj/run-rtadvd, while macOS
26.5.2 still ships /usr/sbin/rtadvd.  The daemon's sources were last
published in network_cmds-705.100.5; this restores its rtadvd.tproj
verbatim from that release -- the eight files its rtadvd target compiled,
their headers, the pathnames header and the manual pages.

